      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_5c28d972",
      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "game_play_scene",
      "label": "Game Play Scene",
      "description": "A scene depicting two people engaged in a game involving wooden blocks. The man is actively interacting with the blocks on a table, while the woman stands behind him, observing. The scene is framed by text that references Parkinson's disease and a stylized brain illustration below, suggesting a thematic context related to therapy or recreation for Parkinson's patients.",
